  "fragment": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-separated-fpqc}\nLet $S$ be a scheme. Let $X$ be an algebraic space over $S$.\nLet $\\{f_i : T_i \\to T\\}_{i \\in I}$ be a fpqc covering of schemes over $S$.\nThen the map\n$$\n\\Mor_S(T, X)\n\\longrightarrow\n\\prod\\nolimits_{i \\in I} \\Mor_S(T_i, X)\n$$\nis injective.\n\\end{lemma}",
